// Article 5. Relocation.
#require "1-schedule.charter".
Fact noticed-move Identified by parent
Fact moved Identified by parent
Act give-move-notice Actor parent Recipient other
  Holds when True
  Creates noticed-move(parent)
Act move-home Actor parent
  Holds when Held(noticed-move(parent)) For 60 days
  Creates moved(parent)

Clause 5.1 => give-move-notice, move-home.
